{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "3b8f16820b98182668d2ea9c330fc0cc811d8d69447d28336021b08400911e96", "ja": "いえ、なんでも……。コホン。", "zh": "没、没什么……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
