{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1022_403sor", "source_sha256": "ead4badbbadbe0ada27a613bd0ca468e7e7d63c5a1a7a183f7061b320f62167d", "ja": "はい、レンズにはお金かけてますから♪", "zh": "是的，镜头可是花了不少钱的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1023_402cpr", "source_sha256": "0fb6723ecc5f418b2807a6332d997c9689cebb9ecfa1967b6f5136153b561b14", "ja": "……なるほど。むしろファインダー越しの方が、\nよく見えるのかもしれませんね。", "zh": "……原来如此。说不定透过取景器，\n反而能看得更清楚呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1024_403sor", "source_sha256": "d195a195c64131ebb707a03c36685dc74c40001c4d2fbed3041753b471fae366", "ja": "ええ、アイドルが輝く瞬間は、これからも逃さず\nバンバン押さえていきますよ～！", "zh": "是的，偶像闪耀的瞬间，今后我也会一个不漏地咔嚓咔嚓拍下来哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "b6934914999e307a2777e498170b5334ded628a874fe80e26ece15790beafbac", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　せっかくですから、\n記念写真を撮ってもらいませんか？", "zh": "啊，对了！难得有这个机会，要不要拍张纪念照？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1026_403sor", "source_sha256": "070f3ef6ccb05cce47bb8e90073e22f38b65d7ea75706f424bf00fcc93bc91e8", "ja": "いいですね！　アイドルを輝かせる側、大人達の1枚と\nいきましょう。はい、みなさん固まってくださ～い。", "zh": "好啊！那就来拍让偶像闪耀的幕后大人们的1张合照吧。来，大家靠拢一点～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1027_president", "source_sha256": "b18bb3dcca2cef3e02dbc95eca5e91fd978612483f9342cccecb0cb5351e5283", "ja": "うむ、じゃあ私はこの辺りにしようかな。", "zh": "嗯，那我选这附近好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1028_402cpr", "source_sha256": "9adba730052cd7516bdc33d57a934f873039b78d478fdbe8934745dc7653e35c", "ja": "じゃ、俺はこっちに……。\n青羽さんは、こいつの隣で。", "zh": "那我就这边……  \n青羽小姐，坐在这家伙旁边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1029_102mis", "source_sha256": "75fbc7648e5b31540a12449b6c1a87d3fa0d226b2b4f6889df6599f8354a4c05", "ja": "あ、はいっ！", "zh": "啊，好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "545b89a0ffab59bc2bdeb77eb843581ea1a72218f49a0d28378387e741ff7266", "ja": "え……あれ？　あ、あの～、俺が真ん中に\nなっちゃってるんで、入れ替わったほうが……。", "zh": "诶……咦？那、那个～，我不小心站到中间了，还是换个位置比较……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1031_101kot", "source_sha256": "bb5f3cdfbb0a41380d226bfd7cb36ec662cacdaa679c2d7e9edb70a6e1ece1fc", "ja": "あら、これでバッチリだと思いますよ♪", "zh": "哎呀，我觉得这样就完美了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1032_president", "source_sha256": "e5e470a98455cf742bbe6f12af7f826de10cccf3ef339df759a60a7885290d1e", "ja": "うむ、シアタープロジェクトの門出を祝う記念写真\nだからね！　ささ、早坂君、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "嗯，这是为了庆祝剧场企划启程的纪念照片！来来，早坂君，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_02_1033_403sor", "source_sha256": "4ce52d971f56deb0b8bd02da7a29fdaea017ccc6f2d5a7c22b56596fa1cae978", "ja": "はいっ、これからのアイドル達の輝きも、すべては\nここから……。輝きの源、いただきです！", "zh": "好！今后偶像们的光芒，也全都将从这里开始……光芒的源头，捕捉到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
